.SH "نام (NAME)"
dnie-tool \- displays information about DNIe based security tokens
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.HP \w'\fBdnie\-tool\fR\ 'u
\fBdnie\-tool\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
The
\fBdnie\-tool\fR
utility is used to display additional information about DNIe, the Spanish National eID card\&.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP
.PP
\fB\-\-idesp\fR, \fB\-i\fR
.RS 4
Show the DNIe IDESP value\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-data\fR, \fB\-d\fR
.RS 4
Show DNIe personal information\&. Reads and print DNIe number and User Name and SurName
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-all\fR, \fB\-a\fR
.RS 4
Displays every available information\&. This command is equivalent to \-d \-i \-V \-s
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-serial\fR, \fB\-s\fR
.RS 4
Displays DNIe Serial Number
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-version\fR, \fB\-V\fR
.RS 4
Show DNIe sw version\&. Displays software version for in\-card DNIe OS
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-pin\fR \fIpin\fR, \fB\-p\fR \fIpin\fR
.RS 4
These options can be used to specify the PIN value on the command line\&. If the value is set to
env:\fIVARIABLE\fR, the value of the specified environment variable is used\&. By default, the code is prompted on the command line if needed\&.
.sp
Note that on most operation systems, any user can display the command line of any process on the system using utilities such as
\fBps(1)\fR\&. Therefore, you should prefer passing the codes via an environment variable on an unsecured system\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-reader\fR \fIarg\fR, \fB\-r\fR \fIarg\fR
.RS 4
Number of the reader to use\&. By default, the first reader with a present card is used\&. If
\fIarg\fR
is an ATR, the reader with a matching card will be chosen\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-wait\fR, \fB\-w\fR
.RS 4
Causes
\fBdnie\-tool\fR
to wait for the token to be inserted into reader\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-verbose\fR, \fB\-v\fR
.RS 4
Causes
\fBdnie\-tool\fR
to be more verbose\&. Specify this flag several times to enable debug output in the opensc library\&.
.RE
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
.PP
\fBdnie\-tool\fR
was written by Juan Antonio Martinez
<jonsito@terra\&.es>\&.
